<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5091" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμεγέθης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without magnitude,
				unextended,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1075b29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				6.5.12
			</span></i>, etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θῶς</span>”
				<i>non-spatially,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Syrian.
					<u>in Metaph.</u>
					85.15
				</span></i>
			; <i>non-quantitatively,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Sent.</u>
				34
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lacking in size,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύγκριμα τῶν μαστῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.88
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>without dignity,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύνθεσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Comp.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				34.4
			</span></i>; of writers, <i><span class="en">
				40.2
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
